+Findings repaired with explicit regression evidence:
+
+1. Fractional limits rounded above their ceiling; fixed by exact initial clamp. Disabled automatic limits no longer override fixed user values; capability ceilings still apply.
+2. Hidden/warmup/backend/reset boundaries could preserve an overload streak; sampler sequence now advances at discontinuities.
+3. WebGL `default` is not a WebGPU power enum; the probe omits that hint. GPU memory and missing sample times remain null.
+4. Form steps blocked schema-valid custom v1 decimals; numeric fields accept arbitrary valid decimals. Lost-context apply now reports unavailable/last-known effective values.
+5. Controller cached runtime metadata after external resize/restart; snapshot reads the existing port and derives restart state from actual values. UI uses that same projection.
+
+`review-red.txt`: seven failing regressions before fixes. `review-pass.txt`: seven pass. `review-runtime-red.txt`: one fail / seven pass before metadata fix. `review-runtime-pass.txt`: eight pass after it. Original control assertions and raw errors remain unchanged.
